                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Looks pretty but plays horribly.\nThe most unresponsive combat I've seen in a long time, character gets stuck facing one direction and ignores prompts to switch. Hit boxes make no sense, you get stun locked and juggled without any tells.\nCan't re-bind keys or see what keys are outside tutorial pop ups.\nAlso is buggy as all hell and many of the programming decisions are amateuristic at best, like the loading at the start, the checkpoint system constantly popping up, game breaking bugs (got stuck in a respawn loop), etc.\n\nFeels like a student project where they didn't think through the program structure correctly from the start ending up in a stiched up mess of game that barely does what's intended...",
